      "message": "Consider replacing the 13 outer int constants (INTERP_*) with a private nested enum on InterpCmdState, renaming traceBracketDepth to delimDepth, and dispatching onPunct/onIdent/onNewline via switch expressions. That makes InterpCmdState self-contained and lets the compiler catch omitted states like INTERP_EXPECT_TRACE_OPEN in onNewline().",
