      "side": 1,
      "message": "InterpCmdState.onPunct resets INTERP_EXPECT_TERM_THEN_QUOTE and INTERP_EXPECT_TERM_THEN_IDENT to INITIAL on `.`, which breaks Lean 4 dot-identifier refs like `throwErrorAt .missing \"{\u0027\\\"\u0027}\"` and `throwNamedErrorAt .missing id \"{\u0027\\\"\u0027}\"`. Accepting `ch \u003d\u003d \u0027.\u0027` alongside whitespace and backtick here is safe because both states have expectsQuote() \u003d\u003d false.",
