      "message": "Hardcoding `state.bracket \u003c\u003d 1` at line 1487 closes early when an interpolated string sits inside a nested attribute bracket (`@[foo [bar, s!\"{ ] }\"]]`, where state.bracket is 2 inside the interpolation). Conversely, an unclosed `[` inside `{ [ }` leaks past closing `}` at line 1374, causing findMatchingBracket(`@[foo s!\"{ [ }\"]`, 1) to return -1 and findMultiLineAttributeEnd to overrun. Store a parallel bracket-floor stack alongside interpBraceDepths, ignore `]` in stopOnBracketZero mode when state.bracket \u003c\u003d floor, and restore state.bracket \u003d floor when returning to inInterpString.",
